{{Interlanguage link|Kii no Kuni no Miyatsuko|ja|紀伊国造}} is a [[Kuni no miyatsuko]] that had a uniquely high amount of power similarr to the [[Izumo clan]].<ref name="mw-2023a">{{Cite web |date=2023-03-10 |title=Kuni no miyatsuko {{!}} 國學院大學デジタルミュージアム |url=https://d-museum.kokugakuin.ac.jp/eos/detail/?id=8839 |access-date=2023-12-02 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230310081317/https://d-museum.kokugakuin.ac.jp/eos/detail/?id=8839 |archive-date=2023-03-10 }}</ref>
They run [[Hinokuma Shrine]].<ref name="mw-2023a" />

They are believed to be buried at [[Iwase-Senzuka Kofun Cluster]]


