* {{ill|Amabe clan|lt=Amabe clan|ja|海部氏|en}}

* {{Interlanguage link|Yoshida family|lt=Yoshida clan|ja|吉田家|en|draft:Yoshida family|simple|User:Immanuelle/Yoshida family}}
