== Genealogy ==

* The "Ki Clan Genealogy" recorded in {{ill|Sonpi Bunmyaku|ja|尊卑分脈|12=draft}} and {{ill|Gunsho Ruijū|ja|群書類従|12=draft}} is inconsistent across generations and cannot be trusted as it stands. Here, {{citation needed|date=April 2017|the genealogy is presented as corrected based on sources such as {{ill|Rokkokushi|ja|六国史|12=draft}}, {{ill|Kugyō Bunin|ja|Kugyō補任|12=draft}}, and {{ill|Ki Clan Genealogical Records|ja|紀氏家牒|12=draft}}}}, although it is noted that there are still differing opinions regarding the early sections and the positions of individuals such as {{ill|Ki Maji|ja|紀麻路|12=draft}}, {{ill|Ki Sarutori|ja|紀猿取|12=draft}}, {{ill|Ki Tanaga|ja|紀田長|12=draft}}, and {{ill|Ki Haseo|ja|紀長谷雄|12=draft}}.

