== Genealogy ==

* The "Ki Clan Genealogy" recorded in [[:en:Sonpi Bunmyaku|Sonpi Bunmyaku]] and [[:en:Gunsho Ruijū|Gunsho Ruijū]] is inconsistent across generations and cannot be trusted as it stands. Here, , {{ill|Kugyō Bunin|ja|Kugyō補任|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Kugyō Bunin|qq=|ja_comment=jawiki link invalid}}, and {{ill|Ki Clan Genealogical Records|ja|紀氏家牒|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Ki Clan Genealogical Records|qq=|ja_comment=jawiki link invalid}}}}, although it is noted that there are still differing opinions regarding the early sections and the positions of individuals such as {{ill|Ki Maji|ja|紀麻路|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Ki Maji|qq=}}, {{ill|Ki Sarutori|ja|紀猿取|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Ki Sarutori|qq=}}, {{ill|Ki Tanaga|ja|紀田長|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Ki Tanaga|qq=}}, and [[:en:Ki no Haseo|Ki Haseo]].

