|支流= Ōda no Hori, Yamashi, Tanba Tatenui-shi, Tsumekou-shi, Takano-shi, {{ill|Ōmura Clan (Divine Clan)|ja|大村氏 (神別)|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Ōmura Clan (Divine Clan)|qq=|1=Ōmura Clan (Shinbetsu)|comment=changed title based on wikidata|WD=Q11436025}}, {{ill|Fujitsu Tachikuni no Mikoto|ja|藤津立国造|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Fujitsu Tachikuni no Mikoto|qq=|ja_comment=jawiki link invalid}}, {{ill|Iwami no Kuni no Mikoto|ja|石見国造|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Iwami no Kuni no Mikoto|qq=|1=Iwami Kuni no Miyatsuko|comment=changed title based on wikidata|WD=Q60990902}}, Niu no Hori, Narahara-shi, Osakake-shi, [[:en:Inbe clan|Imibe-shi]], Kannu-shi, Niu Aimi-shi
